  "title": "Cream of Jerusalem Artichoke Soup",
  "description": "Jerusalem artichokes, potatoes and onions cooked in chicken stock are pureed before combining with brandy and heavy cream. Served hot with minced parsley.",
  "authors": [
    "Michelle Chen"
  ],
